From c1d3480c967e7e727626a11a8acba352e412ad07 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pavel Zwerschke <pavelzw@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:50:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Update fs2 and jobserver to drop winapi 0.2

fs2 0.4.0 and jobserver 0.1.0 depend on winapi 0.2.8, which doesn't
support aarch64 and thus breaks the build on win-arm64.
---
 Cargo.lock | 113 ++++++++++++-----------------------------------------
 1 file changed, 26 insertions(+), 87 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Cargo.lock b/Cargo.lock
index 36f0dd7..eae56de 100644
